  "engineering_conclusion": "Switchboard-attested Jupiter quote jobs are a concrete positive architecture candidate. Signatures would be Switchboard oracle/network attestations over job results, not a native Jupiter signed price feed. This does not establish independent source diversity or make thin/manipulated Jupiter liquidity fair. Fixed quote size, all-in buyback cost/fees/impact, token units, freshness, quorum, bounds, unavailable-route behavior and total compute/account budget need explicit design and qualification. Existing close accepts>=q with bounded spending; no exactly-q incompatibility claimed.",
